00:04:09.170 --> 00:04:10.670
Then we had to think
about how we're

00:04:10.670 --> 00:04:12.175
going to run the software.

00:04:12.175 --> 00:04:13.550
This is a greenfield
application,

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:14.925
like we're starting
from scratch.

00:04:14.925 --> 00:04:16.880
So we have the
opportunity to take

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:20.010
