00:04:30.940 --> 00:04:33.940
We went to Docker, got
the Hello World tutorial,

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:38.920
and just changed it, so that
the Python 3.7 base image is now

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:42.250
uploading or now combining all
the files for our application

00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:44.670
and then running it in
Unicorn of Flask runner.

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:49.010
Cool.

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:51.328
So with that, let's go--

00:04:51.328 --> 00:04:52.370
oh, wait, one more thing.

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:54.828
We want to look and see how
we're running it in production.

00:04:54.828 --> 00:04:56.010
MAX SALTONSTALL: Yep.

00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:58.260
JEN TONG: So we're going to
go on over to the console.

00:04:58.260 --> 00:04:59.840
Since we are also using
